### 2. Bug Root Cause

**Root Cause:**  
Some code locations are formatting numbers (e.g., KB, ms, percentages) using manual rounding and concatenation, rather than using `toLocaleString`. This results in inconsistent number formatting (e.g., missing thousands separators, inconsistent decimal places).

---

### 3. Bug Localization

